<title>FRANCE: Dassault Electronique net 116.6 mln francs.</title>
<headline>Dassault Electronique net 116.6 mln francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)   Net attributable		  profit 116.6  vs     loss 21.4</p>
<p>  Net				   profit 116.5  vs     loss 46.1</p>
<p>  Pre-tax, pre-exceptional	profit 206.0  vs   profit 20.0</p>
<p>  Turnover				   4,559.2  vs	 4,253.7</p>
<p>NOTE - 1995 figures adjusted to reflect the 50 million franc cost for the restructuring of subsidiary Dassault A.T.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
